  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutionalizing Peace in Yemen (IPY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project is to lay the foundation for an inclusive and multi-level infrastructure for peace in Yemen. Progress toward this is envisioned to be made via two complementary components: the drafting of a national policy on peace-building and conflict management (national stream), and the management of a Mediation Support Fund (sub-national stream).&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
